  "description": "Experience Freedom with the Street X · Class 2 Street-Legal E-Bike The Street X · Class 2 Street-Legal E-Bike is your ultimate solution for urban commuting and weekend adventures. Say goodbye to traffic jams and long wait times. This powerful e-bike is designed to bring efficiency and excitement back to your daily travels, allowing you to conquer city streets effortlessly. With a robust 750W DC brushless motor and a top speed of 20MPH, the Street X offers a perfect blend of power and convenience. Its remarkable battery range of up to 65 miles ensures you can travel further without the hassle of frequent recharging, all within a quick 4-6 hour charging time. Lightweight yet sturdy, the aluminum frame supports riders up to 325lbs and has a sleek design that resonates style and functionality. Plus, with advanced hydraulic brakes and 20″ x 4.0″ tires, the Street X guarantees superior handling and safety on various terrains. Powerful 750W motor for effortless rides Up to 65 miles battery range Quick 4-6 hour charging time Durable aluminum frame Supports up to 325lbs Reliable hydraulic brakes for enhanced safety Don’t just get from point A to point B—experience the joy of riding with the Street X · Class 2 Street-Legal E-Bike. Upgrade your lifestyle and embrace the freedom of the open road today!",
